{
  "title": { "en": "Declaring ⊥" },
  "adds": ["botE"],
  "symbols": ["⊥"],
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "A <b>contradiction</b> is a situation that cannot hold, such as “it rains” and “it does not rain” holding together. Once reasoning reaches a contradiction, the premises it rests on cannot all hold."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "The kernel writes a contradiction as the statement ⊥. ⊥ never holds, so its declaration has no introduction rule at all: no premises are enough to prove it. The board holds that declaration."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "en": "The elimination rule of ⊥ has no case to handle, so once ⊥ is held, every goal is derivable: the <b>principle of explosion</b>. “Not” comes from contradiction too: ¬A is defined as A → ⊥, “if A held, it would lead to a contradiction”. So with A and ¬A both as premises, Apply gives ⊥, and from it any statement follows."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "decl-bot",
      "kind": "iso",
      "declare": { "en": "contradiction" },
      "target": "⊥",
      "sentences": ["Rain", "Wet", "Rain → ⊥"],
      "tests": [
        { "given": ["Rain"], "make": false },
        { "given": [], "make": false },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Rain", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Moon ∧ Pigs", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "make": true },
        { "given": ["Wet"], "goal": "Rain", "make": false },
        { "given": ["Rain → ⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": false },
        { "given": ["Rain", "Rain → ⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": true }
      ],
      "solution": [],
      "play": "audit",
      "want": "agree",
      "boards": [{ "rules": [] }],
      "slots": [
        { "given": ["Rain"], "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": [], "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Rain", "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Moon ∧ Pigs", "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["Wet"], "goal": "Rain", "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["Rain → ⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "fixed": ["given", "goal"] },
        { "given": ["Rain", "Rain → ⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "fixed": ["given", "goal"] }
      ],
      "answer": [
        { "given": ["Rain"], "make": false },
        { "given": [], "make": false },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Rain", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Moon ∧ Pigs", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "make": true },
        { "given": ["Wet"], "goal": "Rain", "make": false },
        { "given": ["Rain → ⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": false },
        { "given": ["Rain", "Rain → ⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": true }
      ],
      "naive": [
        { "given": ["Rain"], "make": false },
        { "given": [], "make": false },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Wet", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Rain", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "goal": "Moon ∧ Pigs", "make": true },
        { "given": ["⊥"], "make": true },
        { "given": ["Wet"], "goal": "Rain", "make": false },
